Package: PruneTopGODAGviz
Title: Publication-Quality Pruned Gene Ontology DAG Visualisation
Version: 0.1.11
Authors@R:
    person("Yuzhou Liu", email = "remagenre@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads transcript-level Gene Ontology annotation tables, performs
    over-representation analysis with a self-contained hypergeometric test, and draws
    publication-quality directed acyclic graphs of enriched terms with
    user-controlled branch pruning, chain collapsing and redundancy merging.
    Layout is deterministic and collision-free, and figures are exported as
    vector PDF, PNG, SVG or TIFF.  An interactive Shiny editor supports
    click-to-delete branch pruning, free dragging with a magnetic layout and
    live colour control; standalone HTML output is available through
    'ggiraph'.
